Package: cosmic-sory-ia
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Depends: soryos-archive-keyring, libcap2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0
Description: SoryOS AI engine — CLI, desktop GUI, TUI, and servers
 SoryOS AI is a unified workspace built on a fork of OpenAI Codex
 with COSMIC desktop integration.
 .
 This package contains:
  - sory       : main AI CLI
  - sory-desktop : COSMIC desktop GUI
  - sory-tui   : terminal UI (ratatui)
  - sory-app-server : app server daemon
  - sory-mcp-server  : MCP protocol server
  - sory-exec, sory-execpolicy : sandboxed execution
  - sory-file-search, sory-linux-sandbox
Section: admin
Priority: optional
